[00:07.94]
[00:11.96]What is reflected in my eyes Not the moonlight in a starless midnight
[00:18.61]That showers on the people passing by
[00:24.48]One's so small and the world's so wide
[00:27.68]Every step forward echoes a sigh
[00:31.36]I reach out for the halo far up high
[00:37.11]Deeply engraved my memory is silent but not forgotten indeed
[00:43.99]Someone has gone but a voice within me
[00:49.82]Once I remember all the tales written inside this corp no more frail
[00:56.71]I'll follow what my heart used to believe
[01:03.19]Crash against the barrier above the crowd
[01:11.55]Flaring up pieces in the air to show a fairy starfall
[01:15.99]I want no tomorrow or yesterday
[01:24.12]These sparkles shine and never fade till the break of day
